      "card_ids": ["C04"],
      "claim": "Colistin, a large cyclic peptide antibiotic, has poor CSF penetration in humans with CSF:serum ratios of about 0.05, and low brain-to-plasma ratios in mice, reinforcing the pattern that large peptide macrocycles do not cross the BBB meaningfully.",
